                [97] = "The Fire Armor Class defines how much damage you can mitigate against Fire based attacks.",
                [100] = "Martial Arts is the main unarmed combat skill.  Increasing this allows you to not only hit more often, but to do extra damage per hit.  It's 50% dependent on Agility, 20% on Strength and 30% on Psychic.",
